# Club & Grub - World 1, stage 2: "Canopy Village" (designer w1).
# A tall map around one great tree: climb from the forest floor through the tree houses of the village (lifts,
# a diagonal lift, danglers over gaps, stingers, arc leapers), pick up the axe and learn to throw it, cross the
# trunk top (a bat there bounces the curious up to the crow's nest with the warp to bonus stage A) and come down
# the far side deck by deck to the exit at the trunk's foot.
# Route proof: tools/autoplay/routes/w1_l2.inputs (+ .expert.inputs), replayed by tests/test_levels_w1.gd.

